    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e285b35473ccd45f226ad0a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "隔天，她试着搜索自己的名字，\n但认识到她以及苫小牧的人并不多。\n她发现必须继续提升知名度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6299e9eec640c2ea3f26003727689df987148997ae9e2d9dbb8d9c9311f698d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
