    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a06ab96e5af0471e6905cdd6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而想获得更多关注就必须参加大型比赛。\n为此，她必须在和自己实力相符的比赛中\n逐步累积成就。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9eec668b48c3eaabb65bf0c136c98a5f8da416b4acd7f5bb414f0a3271e1ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099418.json",
