    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f969b525fad2e22914454a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只要累积成就，肯定也能获得更多粉丝。\n她定下在明年春季举办单人活动，\n并让会场座无虚席的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "42b3fb0f713a8f751e4e5dbfd00efd5cfb5efa19ca1e0499a205a869aeb80cc0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099418.json",
