      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后，活动会场决定了。为了在竞赛中\n获得更多粉丝，达成春季活动的目标。\n她开始着手准备──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "593617b39ecb2fa6ff1ddff387cd33b16a9cae8d2fb0ba23e5108e101030e999",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
