    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de4c18dfe62d92b11160fcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但观众却几乎都是苫小牧当地人。\n未能吸引到外地观众，\n让北港火山感到懊恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c9bfcf40748b6956fb1bc24075a43bd41412e9261e448f1c8c60cd33d2db356",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
