    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8a06eb815ef19cdff12624",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但她让苫小牧的人们愿意支持她，\n并将活动办得非常成功。\n这证明她已经是苫小牧的在地偶像。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5537db35130bb2c35b7f35c2e5665874a2341246726453439050869bb73e2163",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
