    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4720a16a5e161a77a920fd05",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "活动结束的几天后。\n醒目飞鹰突然宣布暂停参赛。\n这让北港火山相当愕然。但是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0795d77fc1b99c1c0ece41a5e926cfd990d44257a433ee41a1f5842264909032",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4e7c1fcf4d86d99b003242c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
