      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她表示要趁受到瞩目的现在，进行更大的挑战。\n目标是在GⅠ竞赛中获胜，\n让知名度一口气上升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c63d73b3079b9df9443be4142feb06ccc09f086308ed5dcbd160eef675981e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
