      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山想挑战“日本冠军C”，\n训练员也同意了她的提议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91a96d7578479f4b580b8e532b5d06806c266462cf76023efbfda4d5df62249",
