    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cbce972310a803a3c3f411d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛结束后更新的内容也有了成效，\n让北港火山的知名度顺利提升。\n但她最在乎的苫小牧知名度却没有上升……",
      "source_fingerprint": "580ff6b33eec8badfc1f1b2ebc35c9b84e5380228f2e1fcc0e42133675c6c4e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
