    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3f8657b86be58d45d73a3d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不断在比赛中取得成果，\n却没办法让苫小牧获得关注……\n这让北港火山稍稍感到不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f787e0f0ff32d77f3040d7c896bcf7f0ce3d6eaea6f9333313a1ff36c6591e28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1099/storytimeline_501099421.json",
      "json_path": [
