    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a1e29649c1c44e4861c78a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但北港火山才刚踏上沙土的第一线。\n她相信只要自己成为顶尖选手，情况就会改变，\n于是决定将目标定为“川崎纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c2a97af3906b2f73e4d3da2c4be2d92e2b4a4361de5394477cf903c13b79615",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
