    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad05ca5aab4d26fd7e6a577",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北港火山在比赛中获得佳绩！\n观众的反应也让北港火山\n感受到前所未有的成就感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90dad01dc07f6b14032a8c416326ef752f93aaf16d5d5544d710b77910b961a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
