    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7ddd7e9bbe7ab7aebd3e069",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但社交平台上，却因为一篇认为北港火山\n应该专注于比赛而非在地偶像的贴文，\n引起了正反两方的争论。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e166e2e50afb1ca1d8f2156e00b923994ec9385d8135c98f14c3f167c9fc1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
