      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她为苫小牧努力至今，\n却没有让大家注意到她的想法。\n没人发现她认真看待的事令她感到苦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb0938d7d0924beae27e6fb0849fee76844c6ccd0a37948fcc956bfb6b47238",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
